  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan spends immortal essence saving Hei Lou Lan, Fairy Li Shan offers compensation that includes this killer move among two moves and one Gu recipe. The creator controlled qi escape Gu, then fourth on the Top Ten Mystical Gu list and reverse refined from reputation Gu; in straight-line flight speed that Gu had no match, and he referred to it when designing the move. Fang Yuan first judges the offer suitable because an immortal zombie body’s pores are tough and heal quickly if damaged.",
      "chapters": [
        678
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_qi_escape_immortal_gu",
        "sys_ten_big_mystical_gu",
        "gu_reputation_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He still declines it in the deal. Opening pores across the whole body cuts defense sharply, and the move cannot run with hair armor, which covers the body without gaps; the two block each other. He takes poison breath and the ancient group strength Gu recipe instead, plus four immortal essence stones, and leaves Kong Sheng Tian unbought under cash pressure.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-outcome",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_group_strength_gu",
        "char_kong_sheng_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border Wu clan talk names Kong Sheng Tian as a famous qi path Gu Immortal most skilled at movement methods, and states that the qi path movement killer move he created is also called Kong Sheng Tian.",
      "chapters": [
        2096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "creator-history",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His will later says his main body’s signature method was shooting currents from body pores to move rapidly, and that Hu Land pairs with that killer move so users can scatter and fly out at extreme speed when the will activates Hu Land.",
      "chapters": [
        2098
      ],
